Description: Provides tools for constructing and fitting Multivariate Joint Models
    using the Integrated Nested Laplace Approximation (INLA) approach. The package
    facilitates the specification of complex hierarchical models with multiple
    longitudinal and outcome processes, handling both fixed and random effects.
